      "id": "claim_278c143f887a41118a0e9996bc9aa5da",
      "statement": "Configuration uses Pydantic Settings and environment variables; Local CLI requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (or Foundry settings) and optional classification tuning (N, temperature, confidence threshold); Cloud pipeline additionally requires database URL, Graph credentials (tenant, client ID/secret, drive ID), queue connection string, and processor category file path; filesystem source requires CLASSIFIER_SOURCE=filesystem and CLASSIFIER__FILESYSTEM_ROOT instead of Graph credentials",
